  "answer": "This feature request has been filed several times before. Earlier tickets asked for the same thing: a real-time upload and download speed readout on the Windows taskbar. In #45987 the maintainers said PowerToys can't customize the taskbar directly because the APIs for it are private. They suggested filing the request in the Windows Feedback Hub (WinKey+F). Other earlier tickets (#40247, #42192) were closed as duplicates of #8756, the system performance monitor request. A maintainer there said that PowerToys now has this in the Command Palette Dock. Ticket #45987 also pointed to the concept designs in #45201. Ticket #828, an older request for a taskbar speed meter, was closed as a duplicate of #855, which asks for a common taskbar/deskband integration API. So the practical options are: use the network monitor in the Command Palette Dock, and send the taskbar-indicator request to Windows through Feedback Hub. You could also add your 👍 and any extra context to the existing tickets."
 },
